# state: first-run   (recorded on a disk with no save for the title (NOTES.md E); lane.savestate433)
# Family Guy: Video Game! (545400B0), single route. lane.titleroutes session
# 46, 2026-09-30, from the Thor survey 0-0-s-1790823797-titleroutes-2950719
# (route-frames, booted at 20:41:05 PDT). DRAFT until a soak replays it.
#
# What the survey's START/A cycles did (one press every ~5.5 s):
#   START  204111  title menu: New Game / Options / Continue
#   A      204116  "Select Auto Save": four Empty slots + Exit
#   START  204122  no change
#   A      204128  Empty slot accepted -> the intro clip (PTV dish)
#   START  204134  skips the clip -> "LOADING"
#   A      204142  Stewie's nursery, HUD (health bar, 0/20, ray gun): play
#   START  204148  pauses (Paused: Resume / Quit Level / ...); A resumes
# The play frames (204357-204448, LY held forward + A) show Stewie walked
# from the rug to the changing table: the stick moves him. The game runs
# at ~29-30 (FPS overlay 29); target 30.
#
# So: four cycles, then no START (it pauses). Assumes no Family Guy auto
# save on the disk; with one, the Auto Save list would not be all Empty.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
mark booted
repeat 4 {
    press START
    wait 5
    shot menu-start
    press A
    wait 5
    shot menu-a
}
axis LY min
wait 3
axis LY mid
shot moved
mark gameplay
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 3
    axis LX max
    wait 0.5
    axis LX mid
    press A
    wait 2
    axis LY mid
    axis LX min
    wait 0.5
    axis LX mid
    wait 1
    shot play
}
